          "text": "’Dini kuhani Hilikia pi mu nabi okuru Hulida vu, Ahikamu pie, Akibori pie, Safani pie, Asaya pie. Eri ovu oku Salumu ’ba bongo suza ma ta mbapi, Tikiva Harihasi mvi ma mviniri (eri adri Yerusalemu ma esele iriri ma alia); te yi ’yo e’yo eri be. ",
